              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kokerata kokidin naka Babulon, konyoutu kakwap naka Ikaludean, kosubata bala ikorwa kakonyen nuka isipanin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarai koany, etwekenyuni etodokari da atukot naka atekerin nukapolok asurokin Babulon, nuepote kagolitomei: iderakinos asurokin ŋes: ameun kanen eŋatario. Eraunos ikeeekojoi bala luka ikirigin luenaikinito, lumam eboŋunete epalapalato, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.17.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Apu 17:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebala EJAKAIT ebe, Eŋatario Kaludea: imonikinos kere luenatarete Ŋes,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
