            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iporotoi luka nul kaluekerete aiku anyoun kakwap nako Babulon, alimor koSion enyaijit loka EJAKAIT Ewokodeke, ainyaŋ eyekaluke.",
          "type": "text",
