          "text": "“Konyarautu ikagumak imalia asurokin Babulon, nul kere luikesete akabwai. Kidukuro airigaun; sirikeku imodioke. Kotaeakis kwape ajaar aswamuke; kere nuabu kiswama, kiswamakis ŋes da: naarai iwonono kama ejai EJAKAIT, kama ejai Ekalaunan loka Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
