          "text": " Ebala EJAKAIT ebe, Kwape kolo ebiroria Edeke Sodom ka Gomora ka ireria kere luedunyatar, kwaŋin emameun ituŋanan yeneiaun ŋina, karaida ikoku yenika ituŋanan yeniboiororoi nen.",
